=== README.md ===
# Orders

Order management for a small online shop. Customers place orders, admins manage them and invoices are generated as PDFs.
=== AGENTS.md ===
# Agent guide

## Testing

Run `composer test`. Feature tests cover HTTP behaviour, unit tests cover services.

## Conventions

Controllers stay thin. Pricing and stock rules live in `app/Services`. Authorization lives in policies.
